1. NOXCAT character assets and their recognisable derivatives

   The player character "NoxCat" was produced for the FUTUREMODE 2026
   Hackathon (AI x Creativity track) by regenerating artwork from the official
   NOXCAT IP asset pack (NOXCAT IP_01 to IP_04) used as reference input.

   Under section 7 of the NOXCAT IP Usage Guidelines, the NOXCAT assets and
   their recognisable derivatives remain the property of NOXCAT; neither those
   Guidelines nor the accompanying Licence transfer those rights. Continued
   publication, distribution or commercialisation of work containing the
   assets after the event requires NOXCAT's prior written consent.

   This project is an independent hackathon entry. It is not affiliated with,
   endorsed by, sponsored by or otherwise associated with NOXCAT.

